/*
 * Implements semantic validation for static field access on array types
 * using the path operator `::`.
 *
 * Supported static fields:
 *   - init   — array initializer(ArrayType::INIT)
 *   - len    — compile-time array length
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::path::array
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/path/array.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-22
